{"version":1,"content":"<p>Linux內核開發團隊已將新一輪HID子系統更新合併至正在開發的Linux 7.4內核。此次更新的一大亮點，是加入任天堂Switch 2控制器的初步驅動支持。相關工作由開發者Vicki Pfau代表Valve參與完成，經過16輪補丁修改後，終於進入Linux主線內核。此外，新版本還加入了Pulsar遊戲鼠標驅動，並改進了部分AMD處理器、蘋果Touch Bar以及華碩ROG Ally掌機的硬件支持。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583578.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:45:31.129496+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:35:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:15.514188+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:15.514188+00:00","content_hash":"d7687a22c541772aecd377d5e92ea6eea4632e0636cdb913e95f74b30540f498","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}